Subject: [PATCH] feat(parser): Phase 1.4 S1 - ruling primitives, components,
 table regions

Unify line/thin-rect/stroked-quad ruling into RulePrimitive with drawing
provenance, build connected RuleComponents, and aggregate vertically stacked
components that share a column lattice into one TableRegion with implied outer
boundaries and merge/absorbed evidence.

MICRF103-P03 becomes one 30x6 table (IoU 1.0) and the DS10CP152-P13 invisible
quad-ruled table is detected (IoU 0.9812). Phase 1.2 stays TP46/FP0/FN0 and
Gold v2 negatives are unchanged; drawing rejection remains S3.
